    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/CombinedMetricsAPAC/MetricDefinitions?rev=' id='MetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/CombinedMetricsAPAC' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='11'>All monetary values are in euros. All eur values are using lucanet fx</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Commission:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> net commission revenue after deducting non-marketing share of pickup discounts </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>Commission Rate:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Commission / GFV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Revenue:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Refers to the revenue made from an order in EUR. For dmart orders include supplier funding, front margins and back margins, delivery fee, charges for not hitting minimum order value, service fee and commission fee. For other types of orders, include delivery fee, charges for not hitting minimum order value, service fee and commission fee.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Net Takein:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> commission + service fee + delivery fee</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Eff Takein:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Net Takein - fp attributed voucher</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Original Takein:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Net Takein - fp attributed voucher - fp attributed discount</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Net Delivery Fee:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Delivery fee without vat/ valid order count</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Net Delivery Fee Excl PGO Dmart:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> (Delivery fee without vat, excluding pandago and dmart)/valid order count excluding pandago, dmart</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Eff Delivery Fee:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> (Net Delivery fee - fp attributed delivery fee voucher) / valid order count</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily Active User Count:</run>
              <run fontsize='10'> Daily active user count by analytical customer id. Count of customers who made an order on the day itself</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily MAU Count: </run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Monthly active user count by analytical customer id on a daily basis. i.e for 2023-12-15, if the value is 1000, It means that there has been 1000 distinct monthly active users for the period 2023-12-01 to 2023-12-15. It is expected that this value will increase throughout the month. The value on the last day of the month will be the Monthly Active User Count for the whole month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily Session Count: </run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Count of sessions for the day itself. It is expected to lag by one day</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Marketing ICPGMV: </run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Marketing spend as a percentage of GMV. Negative since Marketing spend is a cost</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Marketing ICPO: </run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Marketing spend per valid order. Negative sice Marketing spend is a cost</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>GMV: </run>
              <run fontsize='10'>Net GMV in Eur.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='100' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='99' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontsize='11'>All monetary values are in euros. All eur values are using lucanet fx</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Definitions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Commission:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> net commission revenue after deducting non-marketing share of pickup discounts </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Commission Rate:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Commission / GFV</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Revenue:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Refers to the revenue made from an order in EUR. For dmart orders include supplier funding, front margins and back margins, delivery fee, charges for not hitting minimum order value, service fee and commission fee. For other types of orders, include delivery fee, charges for not hitting minimum order value, service fee and commission fee.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Net Takein:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> commission + service fee + delivery fee</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Eff Takein:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Net Takein - fp attributed voucher</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Original Takein:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Net Takein - fp attributed voucher - fp attributed discount</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Net Delivery Fee:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Delivery fee without vat/ valid order count</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Net Delivery Fee Excl PGO Dmart:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> (Delivery fee without vat, excluding pandago and dmart)/valid order count excluding pandago, dmart</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Avg Eff Delivery Fee:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> (Net Delivery fee - fp attributed delivery fee voucher) / valid order count</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily Active User Count:</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'> Daily active user count by analytical customer id. Count of customers who made an order on the day itself</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily MAU Count: </run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Monthly active user count by analytical customer id on a daily basis. i.e for 2023-12-15, if the value is 1000, It means that there has been 1000 distinct monthly active users for the period 2023-12-01 to 2023-12-15. It is expected that this value will increase throughout the month. The value on the last day of the month will be the Monthly Active User Count for the whole month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Daily Session Count: </run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Count of sessions for the day itself. It is expected to lag by one day</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Marketing ICPGMV: </run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Marketing spend as a percentage of GMV. Negative since Marketing spend is a cost</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Marketing ICPO: </run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Marketing spend per valid order. Negative sice Marketing spend is a cost</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>GMV: </run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Net GMV in Eur.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
